For this project, I focused on&nbsp;**self-directed learners**, as they tend to be the most active users of Forvo.

This group is diverse: learners vary widely in motivation, routines, habits, and goals. Some pursue deep linguistic knowledge, others focus on casual exploration or practical needs like travel. Understanding this spectrum helps clarify the needs, motivations, and pain points that Forvo should address.

Consequently, this raises the question:&nbsp;*What does an independent language learner look like?*
